These files were extracted from the user-provided SN100 reference project.
The initial extraction copied selected source, resource, and license files
byte for byte. Local changes in qtrpt.h/qtrpt.cpp are marked SN100 local patch.
origins.json records source/current SHA-256 values and each patch's purpose.
qtrpt.pri is the local Qt5 integration file; it preserves NO_BARCODE and leaves
the original optional XLSX implementation disabled.
